; Practice from a quickplay song at 120%, its pause menu's third row: the
; song's sections, then practice, which starts at 100%. Practice's pause
; began: that song in quickplay, at its 120%. Then the pause menus in GH1's
; scene, and practice begun from the menus, whose Return is practice's song
; list.
{song_speed set 120}
(expect {{pause_panel find ghc_practice.btn} showing} 1)
(expect {pause_panel focus_name} ghc_practice.btn)
(expect {song_speed} 100)
